This directory contains a modified copy of google/embeddinggemma-2
(https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Changes: exported with sentence-transformers as a text-only model (vision and audio encoders
removed via vision_config=None, audio_config=None) and weights cast to bfloat16.
README.md is the original model card.
